 "details": "The SNICheck middleware in Traefik ignores wildcard TLSOptions mappings, allowing an unauthenticated attacker to bypass mTLS requirements by using a domain-fronted request. This occurs because the middleware compares the TLS options name used during the handshake with a pre-computed value that may not account for wildcard matches correctly when certain configuration models are applied.",
 "id": "GO-2026-5152",
